msgctxt "3369349"
msgid "CD Bios (Restart Required)"
msgstr "CD-BIOS (omstart krävs)"

msgctxt "3369351"
msgid ""
"Most games can run on 'System Card 3'. 'Games Express' is needed for several"
" unlicensed games."
msgstr ""
"De flesta spel kan köras med System Card 3. Games Express krävs för flera "
"olicensierade spel."

msgctxt "3369365"
msgid "Arcade Card (Restart Required)"
msgstr "Arcade Card (omstart krävs)"

msgctxt "3369375"
msgid "(CD) ADPCM precision"
msgstr "CD, ADPCM-precision"

msgctxt "3369377"
msgid "ADPCM precision"
msgstr "ADPCM-precision"

msgctxt "3369379"
msgid ""
"Full precision of 12-bits for the MSM5205 ADPCM predictor can reduce whining"
" noise during ADPCM playback."
msgstr ""
"MSM5205-ADPCM-prediktorns fullständiga precision på 12 bitar kan minska "
"vinande ljud vid ADPCM-uppspelning."

msgctxt "3369385"
msgid "(CD) CDDA Volume %"
msgstr "CD, CDDA-volym %"

msgctxt "3369387"
msgid "CDDA Volume %"
msgstr "CDDA-volym %"

